{"name": "Morpheus", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling through a dreamscape built from shattered memories, you follow an amnesiac boy across fractured fragments of consciousness \u2014 drawing closer, beat by beat, to a truth he's forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/1fac6d48c889f1fcf2f41f6c281ac9cf.poster.avif?t=1792319072\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/1fac6d48c889f1fcf2f41f6c281ac9cf.webm?t=1792319072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/1fac6d48c889f1fcf2f41f6c281ac9cf.mp4?t=1792319072\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\"Rhythm is your trajectory \u2014 whether 2K, 4K, 6K, or 8K.\"</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\"Every beat is a shot fired.\u00a0Every combo charge the next explosion.\"</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"37\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/d11d63f8b1c055bde9d2da022178a5cd.webp?t=1792319072\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras_big/dd32e05e3e7ee050d15e6fcf59559d4b.avif?t=1792319072\" height=\"292\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/dd32e05e3e7ee050d15e6fcf59559d4b.avif?t=1792319072\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Morpheus Studio is an open-source chart editor that lets you import your favorite songs, and create your own charts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"37\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/9abde6e65d7a5d93320beca76dad8ff8.webp?t=1792319072\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize track width and height! Toggle visual effects on or off!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track and note width, Track and camera angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Core Shatter close-up effect toggle, Combo close-up effect toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Particle effect density, Camera shake intensity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"37\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/fa4ad83731f23ff808d5ff7c08f9ec43.webp?t=1792319072\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Browse memory discs, choose your song, speed, and difficulty, and play tracks from 2K to 8K.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hit memory crystals on beat, deplete enemy HP, shatter crystals, and recover memory fragments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build combos, unleash firepower, and dive into intense rhythm-driven battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect and store memory fragments after each run to unlock the boy\u2019s lost memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the truth behind the dream!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/46638bf72782c4e68ed0ded04fe424c2.poster.avif?t=1792319072\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/46638bf72782c4e68ed0ded04fe424c2.webm?t=1792319072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/46638bf72782c4e68ed0ded04fe424c2.mp4?t=1792319072\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"37\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/6ba4beb19cdeff21d349087520ee622c.webp?t=1792319072\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satisfying Hit Feedback:</strong> Every hit and combo delivers impactful visual feedback for a satisfying feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Speed Tunnel:</strong> A constantly advancing track creates a strong sense of speed in every song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combos That Grow Stronger:</strong> Build your combo to increase firepower. Break it, and everything resets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade-Style Judgement:</strong> Forgiving timing windows keep the action fun, even if you miss the beat slightly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"388\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/8a7464226b9a1fcf1d7af32dc9798e50.poster.avif?t=1792319072\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/8a7464226b9a1fcf1d7af32dc9798e50.webm?t=1792319072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/extras/8a7464226b9a1fcf1d7af32dc9798e50.mp4?t=1792319072\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Locked, loaded, on the beat \u2014 reclaim the boy's lost memories! Morpheus is a futuristic arcade rhythm game built around heavyweight impact.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4960680/8f81d55319e305bae189fd6dcc0398de1cc1da46/header.jpg?t=1792319072", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Rhythm", "Shooter", "Arcade", "Music", "3D", "Cyberpunk"], "developers": "Rainbow Cat Studio", "publishers": "Rainbow Cat Studio", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4960680", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "18 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/fB9QKJPJs-8", "first_seen": 1792274400.0, "review_rank": 24}